---
import Footer from '~/components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '~/components/Header.astro';
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '~/utils/config';
---

<Layout title={`About | ${site.title}`}>
  <Header activeNav="about" />
  <main id="main-content" class="flex-1">
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <section class="border-b-[3px] border-line px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="brutalist-tag">About</span>
          <span class="brutalist-tag-outline">The author</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-display text-5xl tracking-wide sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
          Timon<br/>Jurschitsch
        </h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Content Section -->
    <section class="px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[2fr_1fr]">
          <!-- Main content -->
          <div class="space-y-6 font-body text-lg leading-relaxed text-base/90">
            <p class="first-letter:text-5xl first-letter:font-display first-letter:leading-none first-letter:mr-1 first-letter:float-left first-letter:mt-1">
              I'm very passionate about learning. I listen to a lot of educational
              podcasts, I watch documentaries and read a lot of articles that may or may
              not add something valuable. But the more knowledge I gain, I realize that
              I don't know very much about anything.
            </p>
            
            <p>
              I want to change that. That's why I started this blog. The goal of this is
              that I learn something new almost every day. It does not have to be a
              skill or very fundamental. But writing it down will help me in a few ways:
            </p>

            <div class="brutalist-list-box my-8 border-[3px] border-line bg-card p-6 shadow-[4px_4px_0_0_rgb(var(--color-text-base))]">
              <ul class="space-y-4">
                <li class="flex gap-4">
                  <span class="flex-shrink-0 font-display text-2xl text-accent">01</span>
                  <div>
                    <strong class="font-ui font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Retention</strong>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-base opacity-80">
                      For the brain to remember stuff the same neurons and synapses have to fire multiple times. 
                      Repetition is the key, but not all knowledge we come across can be immediately used. 
                      Writing it down on the other hand is something one might easily do.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </li>
                <li class="flex gap-4 border-t-[2px] border-line pt-4">
                  <span class="flex-shrink-0 font-display text-2xl text-accent">02</span>
                  <div>
                    <strong class="font-ui font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Understanding</strong>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-base opacity-80">
                      The most important part of the 
                      <a href="https://todoist.com/inspiration/feynman-technique" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-accent">Feynman Technique</a>
                      is to imagine explaining something to a child. Breaking your knowledge down
                      into easily digestible chunks will show you gaps in said knowledge that you
                      were unaware of.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </li>
                <li class="flex gap-4 border-t-[2px] border-line pt-4">
                  <span class="flex-shrink-0 font-display text-2xl text-accent">03</span>
                  <div>
                    <strong class="font-ui font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Showing Up</strong>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-base opacity-80">
                      This blog should theoretically force me to keep showing up in learning new things.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <p>
              The journey from studying medicine, working as an anesthesiologist for a
              few years, to a developer is a weird one. Trying to learn something new
              every day will help me gain more knowledge in topics I'm not nearly as
              knowledgeable as I want to be.
            </p>

            <p>
              Join me on this journey of continuous learning. Everyone started somewhere.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Sidebar -->
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="brutalist-sidebar-box border-[3px] border-line bg-card p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0_0_rgb(var(--color-text-base))]">
              <h3 class="mb-4 font-display text-xl tracking-wide">Connect</h3>
              <div class="space-y-3">
                <a href="/posts" class="brutalist-sidebar-link group flex items-center gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter">
                    <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
                    <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
                    <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
                    <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
                    <polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline>
                  </svg>
                  <span>All Posts</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/search" class="brutalist-sidebar-link group flex items-center gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter">
                    <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
                    <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line>
                  </svg>
                  <span>Search</span>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="brutalist-sidebar-box border-[3px] border-line bg-fill p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0_0_rgb(var(--color-accent-rgb))]">
              <h3 class="mb-3 font-display text-xl tracking-wide text-accent">Status</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-sm opacity-80">
                Currently learning in public. Writing about web development, computer science, 
                and whatever else catches my curiosity.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .brutalist-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
    border: 2px solid rgb(var(--color-border-rgb));
    background-color: rgb(var(--color-accent-rgb));
    color: rgb(var(--color-fill-rgb));
  }

  .brutalist-tag-outline {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
    border: 2px solid rgb(var(--color-border-rgb));
    background-color: transparent;
    color: rgb(var(--color-text-base));
  }

  .brutalist-list-box {
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .brutalist-list-box:hover {
    transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 0 rgb(var(--color-accent-rgb));
  }

  .brutalist-sidebar-box {
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .brutalist-sidebar-box:hover {
    transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
  }

  .brutalist-sidebar-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    color: rgb(var(--color-text-base));
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .brutalist-sidebar-link:hover {
    border-color: rgb(var(--color-border-rgb));
    background-color: rgb(var(--color-fill-rgb));
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 0 rgb(var(--color-text-base));
    transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
